**/node_modules
**/dist
# Never copy stale incremental-build state into the build context: with `incremental: true`,
# nest/tsc deletes dist but keeps the tsbuildinfo, so a stale one makes the in-container build
# skip emitting files (-> an empty dist gets deployed). A clean build context avoids the footgun.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.nuxt
**/.output
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
.git
.env
.env.local
.data
tmp
*.log
**/generated
